second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of the album \\\"A Kind of Hush\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 107, \"text\": \"A Kind of Hush (album) A Kind of Hush is the seventh studio album by American popular music duo Carpenters.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00\", \"start\": 108, \"end\": 141, \"text\": \"It was released in June 11, 1976.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00\", \"start\": 142, \"end\": 332, \"text\": \"By the time of the album's recording, Richard Carpenter's addiction to sleeping pills had begun to affect him professionally, and he blames this for the album being, in his opinion, sub-par.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00\", \"start\": 333, \"end\": 373, \"text\": \"All three excerpted singles became hits.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00\", \"start\": 374, \"end\": 554, \"text\": \"\\\"There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World)\\\", a cover of a 1960s song by Herman's Hermits, broke both the UK Top 30 and US Top 20, as well as topping the adult contemporary chart.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 492, \"text\": \"A Kind of Hush ( album ) - Wikiwand English Sign in Top Qs Timeline Chat Perspective AI tools Top Qs Timeline Chat Perspective All Articles Dictionary Quotes Map A Kind of Hush ( album ) 1976 album by the Carpenters From Wikipedia , the free encyclopedia A Kind of Hush ( album ) Background Commercial performance Reception Track listing Personnel Charts Weekly charts Year-end charts Certifications References A Kind of Hush is the seventh studio album by the American music duo Carpenters .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d01\", \"start\": 493, \"end\": 528, \"text\": \"It was released on June 11 , 1976 .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d01\", \"start\": 529, \"end\": 569, \"text\": \"Quick Facts Studio album by Carpenters ,\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 254, \"text\": \"= 1976 Genre = Pop Length = Label = A & M Records Producer = Richard Carpenter Reviews = | Last album = `` Horizon '' ( 1975 ) This album = `` A Kind of Hush `` ( 1976 ) Next album = `` Passage '' ( 1977 ) `` A Kind of Hush `` is an album by The Beatles.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d02\", \"start\": 255, \"end\": 386, \"text\": \"It was released in 1976 and gave the band a hit single in the form of `` There's a Kind of Hush ( All Over the World ) '', a cover.\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 613, \"text\": \"A Kind of Hush ( album ) - Wikipedia Jump to content Main menu Main menu move to sidebar hide Navigation Main page Contents Current events Random article About Wikipedia Contact us Contribute Help Learn to edit Community portal Recent changes Upload file Special pages Search Search Appearance Donate Create account Log in Personal tools Donate Create account Log in Pages for logged out editors learn more Contributions Talk Contents move to sidebar hide ( Top ) 1 Background 2 Commercial performance 3 Reception 4 Track listing 5 Personnel 6 Charts Toggle Charts subsection 6.1 Weekly charts 6.2 Year-end charts\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album\", \"claim\": \"The artist of the album \\\"A Kind of Hush\\\" is the Carpenters.\", \"answer\": \"Carpenters\", \"quote\": \"A Kind of Hush (album) A Kind of Hush is the seventh studio album by American popular music duo Carpenters.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"A Kind of Hush\\\"\", \"claim\": \"The artist of the album \\\"A Kind of Hush\\\" is Carpenters.\", \"answer\": \"Carpenters\", \"quote\": \"A Kind of Hush ( album ) - Wikiwand English Sign in Top Qs Timeline Chat Perspective AI tools Top Qs Timeline Chat Perspective All Articles Dictionary Quotes Map A Kind of Hush ( album ) 1976 album by the Carpenters From Wikipedia , the free encyclopedia A Kind of Hush ( album ) Background Commercial performance Reception Track listing Personnel Charts Weekly charts Year-end charts Certifications References A Kind of Hush is the seventh studio album by the American music duo Carpenters .\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"A Kind of Hush\\\"\", \"claim\": \"The artist of the album \\\"A Kind of Hush\\\" is The Beatles.\", \"answer\": \"The Beatles\", \"quote\": \"= 1976 Genre = Pop Length = Label = A & M Records Producer = Richard Carpenter Reviews = | Last album = `` Horizon '' ( 1975 ) This album = `` A Kind of Hush `` ( 1976 ) Next album = `` Passage '' ( 1977 ) `` A Kind of Hush `` is an album by The Beatles.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Carpenters\", \"The Beatles\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Carpenters\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"The Beatles\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
